.SS shell.packages
Package selection function.
It takes a set of Haskell packages and returns a subset of these
packages with all of their dependencies included in
\f[CR]ghc\-pkg list\f[R].
It can take either a \f[CR]package\f[R] or name (\f[CR]string\f[R]) of a
package which availability can depend on the platform.
.PP
